<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain reports 2.7 mln dinar trade deficit in Q2.</title>
<headline>Bahrain reports 2.7 mln dinar trade deficit in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain on Tuesday reported a 2.7 million ($7.2 million) foreign trade deficit in the second quarter of 1996 after achieving a 43.3 million dinar trade surplus in the first quarter of the year, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures showed.</p>
<p>BAHRAIN TRADE (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p>		    Q2 96   Q1 96   Q4 95   Q3 95   Q2 95</p>
<p>Total exports   366.90  418.30  384.70  364.20  404.90</p>
<p>     oil	  273.80  289.30  236.80  215.50  245.10</p>
<p>   non-oil*	93.10  129.00  147.90  148.70  159.80</p>
<p>Total imports   369.60  375.00  359.80  323.20  349.90</p>
<p>     oil	  164.70  167.00  128.80  116.50  133.70</p>
<p>   non-oil*     204.90  208.00  231.00  206.70  216.20</p>
<p>Trade balance    -2.70  +43.3   +24.9   +41.0   +55.0</p>
<p>*1996 provisional</p>
<p>($1=0.377)</p>
</text>
